.TH DICTATE 1 "August 2026" "dictatr" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dictate \- hotkey voice dictation for Wayland desktops
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dictate
.RI [ command ]
.br
.B dictate-menu
| \fBdictate-tray\fR | \fBdictate-chat\fR | \fBdictate-setup\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dictatr
transcribes speech on the local machine through a Lemonade inference
server and types the result at the cursor, or copies it to the
clipboard when the desktop will not grant typing. Recording stops by
itself when you stop talking. Nothing is sent off the machine.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B dictate type
Start listening; run again to stop and commit. The default.
.TP
.B dictate clip
As above, but the transcript goes to the clipboard.
.TP
.B dictate cancel
Abort the current recording without transcribing.
.TP
.B dictate file \fIPATH\fR
Transcribe an audio file.
.TP
.B dictate setup
Run the setup wizard: inference engine, typing permission, hotkeys.
.TP
.B dictate backend \fISUBCOMMAND\fR
Inspect or drive the inference backend:
.BR status ,
.BR start ,
.BR stop ,
.BR models ,
.BI "pull " MODEL .
.SH OTHER PROGRAMS
.TP
.B dictate-tray
The resident tray icon: owns the hotkeys and offers first-run setup.
.TP
.B dictate-menu
A floating radial menu of dictatr's actions.
.TP
.B dictate-chat
Voice conversation with a local model, with recall over past dictations.
.TP
.B dictate-setup
The setup wizard, same as \fBdictate setup\fR.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/dictatr/config.toml
Settings. Every key can also be given as an environment variable.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dictatr/
The managed inference engine and its state.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LEMONADE_URL
Use exactly this server, skipping all backend detection.
.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation at
.UR https://github.com/Rebreda/dictatr
.UE
